{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useHeldKeys(): Ref<string[]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/vue-hotkeys/src/useHeldKeys.ts#L29","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useHeldKeys.ts:29"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue composable that returns a reactive ref of currently held keyboard keys."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This composable uses "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSelector"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/vue-store"},{"type":"text","value":" to subscribe\nto the global KeyStateTracker and updates whenever keys are pressed\nor released."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Ref"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":"[]>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reactive ref containing array of currently held key names"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup>\nimport { useHeldKeys } from '@tanstack/vue-hotkeys'\n\nconst heldKeys = useHeldKeys()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    Currently pressed: {{ heldKeys.join(' + ') || 'None' }}\n  </div>\n</template>","lang":"vue"}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useHeldKeys(): Ref<string[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useHeldKeys.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/vue-hotkeys/src/useHeldKeys.ts#L29)\n\nVue composable that returns a reactive ref of currently held keyboard keys.\n\nThis composable uses `useSelector` from `@tanstack/vue-store` to subscribe\nto the global KeyStateTracker and updates whenever keys are pressed\nor released.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Ref`\\<`string`[]\\>\n\nReactive ref containing array of currently held key names\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { useHeldKeys } from '@tanstack/vue-hotkeys'\n\nconst heldKeys = useHeldKeys()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    Currently pressed: {{ heldKeys.join(' + ') || 'None' }}\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useHeldKeys\ntitle: useHeldKeys\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useHeldKeys(): Ref<string[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useHeldKeys.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/vue-hotkeys/src/useHeldKeys.ts#L29)\n\nVue composable that returns a reactive ref of currently held keyboard keys.\n\nThis composable uses `useSelector` from `@tanstack/vue-store` to subscribe\nto the global KeyStateTracker and updates whenever keys are pressed\nor released.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Ref`\\<`string`[]\\>\n\nReactive ref containing array of currently held key names\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { useHeldKeys } from '@tanstack/vue-hotkeys'\n\nconst heldKeys = useHeldKeys()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    Currently pressed: {{ heldKeys.join(' + ') || 'None' }}\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n"}
